# Dragonspire City — mountain citadel of the Dragon Clan at the foot of the Dusk Spire. Gym 8 (Ryuga, Dragon).
# B3: west column open exactly at y=10,11 (connect west route12 4). East: Route 13 (closed until Eclipse is stopped).
# South: Umbral Pass toward Prism Summit (opened by the Dusk Badge). B4: Pokémon Center map id = dragonspire_center.
map dragonspire_city
name "Dragonspire City"
location "Dragonspire City"
music town_mountain
environment grass
region 9 1
fly 25 9
tags town
encounters p3b_dragonspire
connect west route12 4
connect east route13 2
connect south umbral_pass 6

