sign 3 12 text="DRAGONSPIRE CITY\nWhere wings meet the dusk."
sign 19 7 text="DRAGONSPIRE GYM - THE DUSK SPIRE\nLeader: RYUGA\nThe Wings of Twilight!\pChallengers must carry seven Badges."
sign 15 25 text="UMBRAL PASS ahead\nTo PRISM SUMMIT.\nClan permission required."
sign 33 12 text="ROUTE 13 ahead\nVictory Road - Prism Plateau"
sign 21 13 text="SCALEMIRROR POND\nPlease do not feed the Dratini. They are not here. Probably."
